806">to</span> <span begin="41.806" end="42.066">check</span> <span begin="42.066" end="42.227">up</span> <span begin="42.227" end="42.367">on</span> <span begin="42.367" end="42.507">your</span> <span begin="42.527" end="42.868">pro</span><span begin="42.868" end="43.269">file</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为能下定决心 不去关注你的动态</span></p><p begin="43.442" end="45.550" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.442" end="43.563">But</span> <span begin="43.583" end="43.823">then</span> <span begin="43.823" end="43.924">I</span> <span begin="43.924" end="44.365">scrolled</span> <span begin="44.365" end="45.389">down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但当我向下细细浏览</span></p><p begin="46.224" end="48.910" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.224" end="46.444">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="46.444" end="46.625">when</span> <span begin="46.625" end="46.745">I</span> <span begin="46.745" end="46.986">saw</span> <span begin="46.986" end="47.126">that</span> <span begin="47.126" end="47.286">new</span> <span begin="47.286" end="47.567">boy</span> <span begin="47.567" end="47.707">all</span> <span begin="47.707" end="47.888">up</span> <span begin="47.888" end="47.988">in</span> <span begin="47.988" end="48.168">your</span> <span begin="48.228" end="48.569">com</span><span begin="48.569" end="48.910">ments</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在那时，我看见那个男孩频频出现在你的评论里</span></p><p begin="49.005" end="51.780" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.005" end="49.266">Knew</span> <span begin="49.266" end="49.467">y&apos;all</span> <span begin="49.467" end="49.628">were</span> <span begin="49.628" end="50.010">talk</span><span begin="50.010" end="50.151">in&apos;,</span> <span begin="50.151" end="50.171">I</span> <span begin="50.352" end="50.633">felt</span> <span begin="50.633" end="50.754">it</span> <span begin="50.754" end="50.855">in</span> <span begin="50.855" end="50.895">my</span> <span begin="